{title: Khaab}
{artist: Akhil}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
Intro: [Am] [F] [C] [G],        Mai jadon tere [Am]khaab an wale [F]rah tureya
Main tureya bada [C]na maithon jawe [G]mudeya
O jive rehnde [Am]panne nal panne judd [F]de
Main ravaan tere [C]nal ohna waangu [G]judeya
Main likhda [Am]hunda si tere baare [F]adiye
Jaa ke puchle [C]gawah ne taare [F]adiye,        Jo karde [Am]mazak ohna hass [F]lainde
Jo taane [C]kassde ohna nu kass [G]lainde,        [Am]Dil tainu rehnda sadda [F]chete karda
Kise [C]hor te na maare tere te [G]hi marda,        [Am]Ban meri rani tera [F]raja ban jaan
Tu hi ban [C]mera ghar dar [G]waza ban jaan
O tainu vekh [Am]jaava tere val [F]rudeya
Tu fool te main [C]tahni wangu naal ju [G]deya
Mai jado tere [Am]khaab an wale [F]rah tureya
Mai tureya ba [C]da na maithon jawe [G]mudeya
O jive rehnde pan [Am]ne nal panne judd [F]de
Main ravaan tere [C]nal ohna waangu jud [G]eya
Layi na tu mainu [Am]bahute laare [F]adiye,        Ni hor kitte [C]rehjiye kunware [G]adiye
Mere supne ba [Am]de ne keh [F]lainde,        Na bhejj main [C]dur nede reh [G]lai de
Ae pyar rahe [Am]pura na rahe [F]thudeya
Main umraan [C]tayi tere naal raha [G]judeya
Mai jado tere [Am]khaab an wale [F]rah tureya
Main tureya ba [C]da na maithon jawe [G]mudeya
O jive rehnde pan [Am]ne nal panne judd [F]de
Main ravaan tere [C]nal ohna waangu jud [G]eya
Aa kathe ho ke [Am]duniya bana [F]laye,        Rusiye te ta [C]jhat hi mana [G]laye
Choli teri [Am]khushiyaan naal bhar [F]daunga,        Supne aa [C]wala tainu ghar [G]daunga
Ae fikke [Am]nahi laare eh sahchi gudde [F]aa
Tere lai ae [C]haath Rabb agge jud [G]eya
Mai jado tere [Am]khaab an wale [F]rah tureya
Main tureya ba [C]da na maithon jawe [G]mudeya
O jive rehnde pan [Am]ne nal panne judd [F]de
Main ravaan tere [C]nal ohna waangu jud [G]eya
